  "body": "[Spec](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.6.1#delete-matrix-client-r0-directory-room-roomalias) says we should return 404.\r\n\r\nAFAICS we only return 200 (or maybe 500 if there's an internal server error).\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/2af6d31b78109a989e27128ac655990c35b29d62/synapse/rest/client/directory.py#L94-L124\r\n\r\nDiscovered because mypy spotted the return type hint here was wrong (we may return `None`):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/40a1fddd1b7843c25248fca409debab6d8393c59/synapse/storage/databases/main/directory.py#L136-L159",
